C"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "1893320078309704", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622202_1893320084976370_3291719562959093507_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=B1JTIx7B1zEQ7kNvwFwID7d&_nc_oc=AdpsO3TRBQl6-OMo546o3A3N7nwbGnwqWK38oxZKydjTPwJCRO988UlCfg-oShYaZZQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSHf47lsYqr1-09a-IJRtZJkyvrwJcCEqCCxi7sse7rfw&oe=6AF34953"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "2067491287465139", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/593767690_2067491294131805_1605614991949646003_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hfz6k8QI1L8Q7kNvwFAdyjJ&_nc_oc=AdptXrOO6pPbf1CMYvYstioW4fX37cGkOf0DzWGvvECMcpwBS0JHSVr3PaJjWGb2ts0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTWwftQ649C3wrQ9zeVQO9l7W-m2lVE1EAHph9mS-bmOA&oe=6AF33936"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "cover-landscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "1119487634362626", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499627477_1119487637695959_8974769173452468099_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=42W5eZR8r5MQ7kNvwFjmJk1&_nc_oc=Adrn7u5znI4E-Ch2enOmKFBC3RlBPj57MI0kATlsq0bbX1Pd5C4zi1pcJ53Mx1EU9UE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRAbbIFwXsGMguqB7chy59iC0j-dUd126VEv_b8tDEudw&oe=6AF3571B"}, "display_name": "Purple Mars - Free Demo", "keywords": ["shooter", "flying", "shmup", "dogfight", "robots"], "long_description": "**Your first four waves are free.**\n\nThis demo gives you the opening of Purple Mars. Finish four waves, then see how fast you can do it again. Your best time is waiting on the title screen.\n\n**Point. Pull. Fly.**\n\nAim your hand where you want to be and squeeze. Feather the trigger to drift; bury it to tear across the sky. No plane to wrestle, no inertia to fight, no altitude you're stuck at.\n\n**The whole sky is the arena.**\n\nCube-built robots pace, evade, chase and taunt through open 3D space, above you and below. Climb over them, drop beneath them, or hang still and watch the swarm come. The y-axis is yours.\n\n**Aggression is power.**\n\nKills, combos and loot feed your momentum, and your weapon answers in kind: one bolt becomes a spreading circle of seven, faster and wilder the harder you push. Coast, and it drains away.\n\n**Fly the bomb as well.**\n\nOne hand holds you in the air; the other steers a live bomb through the swarm. It won't burst on impact \u2014 it waits for your grip. Time it right and the shockwave takes the whole gang at once.\n\n**Break beautiful things.**\n\nEvery enemy is built from cubes and dies like it. One clean hit to the eye and the whole thing bursts apart, every block flung with the speed it was carrying. Then chase the wreckage down too, if you can.\n\n**Sixteen waves. One planet. Your best run.**\n\nThe full game takes you through all sixteen waves, five Challenge levels from Little to OMG, and the complete original soundtrack. When three waves aren't enough, it's waiting for you.", "short_description": "Point where you want to go. Pull the trigger. Fly.\n\nThis is the free demo of Purple Mars, an arcade shooter built native for VR. Clear the first four waves, then chase your fastest time. No cockpit, no inertia, no arena walls \u2014 just the open sky of an alien planet and swarms of cube-built creatures to burst into tumbling wreckage.\n\nMaster the opening. Then take on all sixteen waves."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://aliencampfire.com/privacy.php", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Alien Campfire LLC", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.purplemarsgame.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}], "extern